{"catch":"快跑……鴨子已經來了。","desc":"你醒來時發現自己身處一個被洪水淹沒的迷宮。\n\n每一步都浸透著水，從一開始就讓人覺得逃脫毫無希望。\n\n每一次轉彎，本能都佔據了主導。\n\n行動不再是一種選擇──而是為了生存。\n\n沒有時間猶豫，無處可藏，也無法確定下一個轉角究竟是什麼。\n\n現在，只有一條規則：\n\n不停地跑。絕不回頭。\n\n最重要的是──千萬別讓鴨子追上你。","publisher":"CGI LAB GAMES","release":"2026-02-05","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.5GB / Switch 0.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1717b17e04a9e6625c854b6581d797af16dfa8892e6f5df582ab148f768c876f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/67e24f0428d9bc3f7ffaae9d2c4797ab2a4e31b75bb5b13d3b0bc1f3354b4ccb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c98ae3df678851bbf1e18cc800e4c3ad5aeec15d26e038b23e486d20e21b7d75.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/432b72dc15dacdb9f967c7a4f6f70e41645030aae666350861a42d4cf662d863.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6b6c5d0944f5f449198dd7eab37f2d546865f25ed163f102b3c5b751389b058b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7c21e2388ff339483d8997bc5055a396a1c556ab14d29bbb03012f50331d6e33.jpg"]}